<title>RUSSIA: Russia PM Chernomyrdin sends tax code to Duma.</title>
<headline>Russia PM Chernomyrdin sends tax code to Duma.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prime Minister Viktor Chernomyrdin signed an order on Wednesday submitting a new tax code and a sequester bill cutting spending in the 1997 budget, to the State Duma lower house of parliament, a government spokesman said.</p>
<p>The transfer of the tax code to the Duma is one of the conditions set by the International Monetary Fund for releasing money to Russia this year.</p>
</text>
